Z||000026||batboy||11-15-1999||11:32 PM||||The NFS High Stakes game is the newest one (I think). Sounds like you may need to download it again. If the NFS3 demo is still available, you may try that instead, Darklord says it's basically the same thing except the new one has more tracks, cars, shows damage after crashes, and better physics. It'll still give you a good feel for the game. I wish they'd bring back that city freeway setting from the first NFS, I liked trying to outrun the cops while weaving through traffic at 140 MPH. What a rush!||||reg||1
