Z||000033||ChadMan||11-16-1999||07:35 PM||||I downloaded the Fiero for NFS3 and it's great - I especially like the way it understeers when you're hard on the gas (just like a real one!).  You can also make it an authentic 87 blue with the custom color settings.<P>My only beef is that the acceleration seems a little too strong.  It really shouldn't be any quicker than the C5 Vette, I wouldn't think.  Still, I'm just glad to have a Fiero to drive.  Has anyone tried the General Lee yet?  It's unrealistic (top speed: 235) but fun, and it has a "Dixie" horn.||||reg||1
