Z||000050||DaRkLoRD||11-19-1999||11:16 PM||||four50four, I had the same problem. It was my joystick.. (logitech wingman extreme) Really have to push forward hard on it to get it to shift with an auto. What I did was map the accelerator to the trigger.. it's a bit imprecise, either flooring it or no gas at all. but it works ok.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>As for the numbers on the dash, it depends on your resolution. Try setting the video mode to something higher see if it helps. Of course, if you're running 1024 x 768 or higher (or even 800 x 600) and it's still blurry.. I'm not sure!||||reg||1
